<title>USA: Deluxe Corp Q1 net rises, sales fall.</title>
<headline>Deluxe Corp Q1 net rises, sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.50		  $  0.23</p>
<p> Net			 41,425		   18,921</p>
<p> Sales		    466,476		  488,088</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  82,200		   82,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q1 net includes net pretax restructuring charge of $34,833,000 or $0.25 a share after tax, from closing 21 check printing plants and moving PaperDirect's operations from New Jersey to existing facilities in Colorado and Minnesota.</p>
<p>		   ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
